  "details": "On headsets such as Varjos, Pimaxs, Galaxy XR, Apple Vision Pro and other high PPD headsets the \"full\" mirror resolution is extremely pixelated where as \"unlimited\" will more than halve performance, even in a solo instance making it unusable.\n\nI propose that we get a new resolution option somewhere between full and unlimited or alternatively update the preexisting ones to be more adequate for modern headsets as were no longer stuck in the 10PPD era.",
